elp? Reach out to us at +919930011706 or support@soulsensei.inâweâre happy to to assist!\n\nWe hope you enjoy the session! â¨\n\n{{Register Now}} - CTA", "templateId": "1. 1a51cf7f-6c19-4864-b61c-285d82dcd103\n2. 4c46959b-4569-48cf-98a0-599fc42f6ce3", "platform": "Gupshup"}, "push": {"used": false, "copy": null, "templateId": null, "platform": null}, "email": {"used": false, "copy": null, "templateId": null, "platform": null}, "incomplete": false, "audience": null, "trigger": null, "status": null, "owner": null, "lastUpdated": null, "version": null, "notes": null}, {"id": "REC-014", "sourceRowWhatsapp": 15, "sourceRowPush": null, "sessionTypeRaw": "Group Free, Group Paid", "useCaseRaw": "Abandoned Cart", "timingRaw": "T -  30 Min", "sessionTypes": ["Group Free", "Group Paid"], "useCases": ["Abandoned Cart"], "timings": ["T -  30 Min"], "timingSortKey": -30, "phaseRaw": "Pre-session", "phase": "pre", "channelsUsed": ["whatsapp"], "whatsapp": {"used": true, "copy": "\n\n\n\n{{ Leader_image}}\n\nHi Shruti, \n\nGentle reminder! Your seat in Gain Clarity In Live Tarot Reading at 4:00 PM today with Aparnnashri Mishra is about to be released.\n\nWe saved your cart because we believe this program found you for a reason.\n\nPlus, every paid session comes with a complimentary bonus session: a gift very few members receive ð\n\nSecure your place: https://www.soulsensei.in/s/sgK\n\nTeam SoulSensei", "templateId": null, "platform": "Wati"}, "push": {"used": false, "copy": null, "templateId": null, "platform": null}, "email": {"used": false, "copy": null, "templateId": null, "platform": null}, "incomplete": false, "audience": null, "trigger": null, "status": null, "owner": null, "lastUpdated": null, "version": null, "notes": null}, {"id": "REC-015", "sourceRowWhatsapp": 16, "sourceRowPush": null, "sessionTypeRaw": "Group Free, Group Paid, Group Offline", "useCaseRaw": "Digital Goods Recording", "timingRaw": null, "sessionTypes": ["Group Free", "Group Paid", "Group Offline"], "use